{"packs":[{"id":"daily","title":"日常开口","words":[{"ex":"Actually, I don't like coffee.","exZh":"其实，我不喜欢咖啡。","word":"actually","zh":"实际上；其实"},{"ex":"Anyway, let's start.","exZh":"反正，我们开始吧。","word":"anyway","zh":"不管怎样；反正"},{"ex":"Basically, we just need more time.","exZh":"基本上，我们只是需要更多时间。","word":"basically","zh":"基本上"},{"ex":"Exactly! That's what I mean.","exZh":"没错！我就是这个意思。","word":"exactly","zh":"正是；完全正确"},{"ex":"I'll probably be late.","exZh":"我可能要迟到了。","word":"probably","zh":"可能；大概"},{"ex":"I'll definitely be there.","exZh":"我肯定会去。","word":"definitely","zh":"肯定；一定"},{"ex":"Honestly, I don't know.","exZh":"老实说，我不知道。","word":"honestly","zh":"老实说"},{"ex":"Seriously, you have to try it.","exZh":"说真的，你一定要试试。","word":"seriously","zh":"说真的"},{"ex":"Maybe we can go tomorrow.","exZh":"也许我们明天可以去。","word":"maybe","zh":"也许"},{"ex":"Of course, you can come with us.","exZh":"当然，你可以跟我们一起来。","word":"of course","zh":"当然"}]},{"id":"work","title":"工作学习","words":[{"ex":"Let me check my schedule first.","exZh":"我先看一下我的日程。","word":"schedule","zh":"日程；安排"},{"ex":"The deadline is Friday.","exZh":"截止日期是周五。","word":"deadline","zh":"截止日期"},{"ex":"We have a meeting at ten.","exZh":"我们十点有个会。","word":"meeting","zh":"会议"},{"ex":"This project is almost done.","exZh":"这个项目快做完了。","word":"project","zh":"项目"},{"ex":"I need to finish this report today.","exZh":"我今天得写完这份报告。","word":"report","zh":"报告"},{"ex":"Let's discuss it after lunch.","exZh":"我们午饭后讨论一下吧。","word":"discuss","zh":"讨论"},{"ex":"We need to decide today.","exZh":"我们今天得定下来。","word":"decide","zh":"决定"},{"ex":"I'll prepare the slides tonight.","exZh":"我今晚准备幻灯片。","word":"prepare","zh":"准备"},{"ex":"I want to improve my English.","exZh":"我想提高我的英语。","word":"improve","zh":"改进；提高"},{"ex":"You can achieve anything if you keep going.","exZh":"只要坚持下去，你什么都能做到。","word":"achieve","zh":"实现；达到"}]},{"id":"life","title":"出门生活","words":[{"ex":"This food is delicious!","exZh":"这东西真好吃！","word":"delicious","zh":"美味的"},{"ex":"These shoes are very comfortable.",