is the museum.","exZh":"下一站是博物馆。","word":"stop","zh":"站；停"},{"ex":"I'm lost, can you help me?","exZh":"我迷路了，你能帮帮我吗？","word":"lost","zh":"迷路的"},{"ex":"What time do we arrive?","exZh":"我们几点到？","word":"arrive","zh":"到达"}]},{"id":"phone","title":"打电话网络","words":[{"ex":"I'll call you tonight.","exZh":"我今晚给你打电话。","word":"call","zh":"打电话"},{"ex":"I sent you a message.","exZh":"我给你发了条消息。","word":"message","zh":"消息；短信"},{"ex":"I forgot my phone at home.","exZh":"我把手机忘在家里了。","word":"phone","zh":"手机；电话"},{"ex":"What's the wifi password here?","exZh":"这里的无线网密码是多少？","word":"wifi","zh":"无线网络"},{"ex":"I buy everything online.","exZh":"我什么都在网上买。","word":"online","zh":"在线；上网"},{"ex":"I need to download this app.","exZh":"我得下载这个应用。","word":"download","zh":"下载"},{"ex":"Can you take a photo for me?","exZh":"你能帮我拍张照片吗？","word":"photo","zh":"照片"},{"ex":"Let's watch a video together.","exZh":"咱们一起看个视频吧。","word":"video","zh":"视频"},{"ex":"Please send me the address.","exZh":"请把地址发给我。","word":"send","zh":"发送"},{"ex":"Why didn't you answer my call?","exZh":"你为什么没接我电话？","word":"answer","zh":"接（电话）；回答"}]},{"id":"health","title":"身体看病","words":[{"ex":"I feel sick today.","exZh":"我今天感觉不舒服。","word":"sick","zh":"生病的；不舒服的"},{"ex":"I'm very tired, I need a rest.","exZh":"我很累，需要休息一下。","word":"tired","zh":"累的"},{"ex":"I have a headache.","exZh":"我头疼。","word":"headache","zh":"头疼"},{"ex":"You should see a doctor.","exZh":"你应该去看看医生。","word":"doctor","zh":"医生"},{"ex":"Take this medicine twice a day.","exZh":"这个药一天吃两次。","word":"medicine","zh":"药"},{"ex":"You need more rest.","exZh":"你需要多休息。","word":"rest","zh":"休息"},{"ex":"I didn't sleep well last night.","exZh":"我昨晚没睡好。","word":"sleep","zh":"睡觉"},{"ex":"My leg hurts.","exZh":"我的腿疼。","word":"hurt","zh":"疼；受伤"},{"ex":"He has a fever.","exZh":"他发烧了。","word":"fever","zh":"发烧"},{"ex":"Eating vegetables is healthy.","exZh":"吃蔬菜对身体健康。","word":"healthy","zh":"健康的"}]},{"id":"feelings","title":"心情感受","words":[{"ex":"You make me so happy.","exZh":"你让我特别开心。","word":"happy","zh":"开心的"},{"ex":"Don't be sad, I'm here.","exZh":"别难过，我在这儿呢。","word":"sad","zh":"难过的"},{"ex":"He was angry with me.","exZh":"他生我的气了。","word":"angry","zh":"生气的"},{"ex":"Don't be afraid, it's just a dog.","exZh":"别害怕，它只是一只狗。","word":"afraid","zh":"害怕的"},{"ex":"I always feel nervous on stage.","exZh":"我一上台就紧张。","word":"nervous","zh":"紧张的"},{"ex":"I'm bored, let's go out.","exZh":"我好无聊，咱们出去吧。","word":"bored","zh":"无聊的"},{"ex":"I was surprised to see him here.","exZh":"在这儿见到他我很吃惊。","word":"surprised","zh":"吃惊的"},{"ex":"She feels lonely in the new city.","exZh":"在新城市她觉得很孤单。","word":"lonely","zh":"孤单的"},{"ex":"I'm glad to see you again.","exZh":"再次见到你我很高兴。","word":"glad","zh":"高兴的"},{"ex":"He is a little shy.","exZh":"他有点害羞。","word":"shy","zh":"害羞的"}]}],"version":2}
